        {
          "id": 508741258,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "```\n  iph->ip_proto = tvb_get_guint8(tvb, offset + 9);\n  if (tree) {\n    proto_tree_add_item(ip_tree, hf_ip_proto, tvb, offset + 9, 1, ENC_BIG_ENDIAN);\n  }\n```\n`ip_proto` is set before the `tree` check and not touched if no `tree`  \nOther variables set inside a `tree` block are not used in calculating expert info messages.",
